---
layout: layouts/page.njk
copyStatus: draft
title: "Selected work and founder experience | Therefore Tech"
description: "Selected work and founder experience from Therefore Tech: what we have built, and the experience behind it."
eyebrow: "Selected work"
h1: "Selected work"
intro: "What we have built, and the experience behind it. We only publish work we can describe honestly."
---
{%- for item in home.work.items %}
{%- set isLive = not item.heldBackUntilConfirmed or showDraftMarks %}
{%- if isLive %}
<h2>{{ item.title }}</h2>
<p class="t-label t-muted">{{ item.kind }}{% if item.status == "draft" and showDraftMarks %} · draft{% endif %}</p>
<p>{{ item.body }}</p>
<p><a href="{{ item.url }}">Read more<span class="visually-hidden"> about {{ item.title }}</span></a></p>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
